      "id": "claim_6922278c8d0e4cc4af2b3f2a0875dc70",
      "statement": "The workspace git store writes byte-identical git loose objects (SHA-1, zlib, one storage record per object) using only isomorphic-git plumbing, has no ref layer (refs are gadget/blueprint/chat records), deduplicates related histories at blob/tree level, and performs no GC because dangling objects are cheap and roots are enumerable.",
